      <p class="lp-eyebrow">A modern artifact repository</p>
      <h1>The artifact repository <span class="lp-accent">with no database.</span></h1>
      <p class="lp-lede">
        Jenesis Repository keeps everything it knows in the storage you already trust - a bucket or a disk - and
        nothing anywhere else. There is no database to run, back up or migrate, and what it derives it repairs on
        its own. It is a repository that runs itself.
      </p>
      <ul class="lp-pills" aria-label="At a glance">
        <li><strong>Zero ops</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Self-healing</strong></li>
        <li>An object store or a disk</li>
        <li>More than twenty ecosystems</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <figure class="lp-terminal" aria-label="Starting Jenesis Repository with Docker">
