          </li>
          <li>
            <p>Read the one-time key from its log.</p>
            <div class="lp-command"><pre><code>docker logs jenesis</code></pre></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>Open <code>http://localhost:8080</code>, choose <em>Sign in with a key</em>, and follow the setup
