          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-helm" aria-labelledby="tab-helm" hidden>
        <ol class="lp-howto">
          <li>
            <p>Install the chart - on a volume, or on any object store with its values beside it.</p>
            <div class="lp-command"><pre><code>helm install jenesis \
  oci://registry-1.docker.io/jenesisbuild/jenesis \
  --set store.backend=s3 \
  --set store.s3.bucket=my-artifacts</code></pre></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>Probes, a service and an optional ingress come with it; any other setting is a value.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-cloud" aria-labelledby="tab-cloud" hidden>
